      "ordinal": 9,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "6.2",
      "title": "Specific Requirements",
      "body": "Heater Shields must:\n● conform to the General Requirements and Wooden Shield requirements (see Sections 3 and 4 above),\n● be made of wood,\n● have a rectangular shape with a pointy shape at the bottom:\n\n● be curved, not flat:\n\n● have a length of 55 cm to 75 cm,\n● have a width of 30 cm to 65 cm,\n● have handles made of leather:\nExample:\n\nPicture from O. Haguenstein ©\n\nIt is allowed to add a Shield boss (umbo) on a Heater Shield with a central handle, as documented by historical sources.\nCentral handles must be made of wood.",
