    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "8.2",
      "title": "Specific Requirements",
      "body": "Round Shield must:\n● conform to the General Requirements and either the Wooden Shield Requirements or the Metal Shield Requirements (see Sections 3, 4 and 5 above),\n● be made of wood or metal, ○ Any metal Round Shields must be approved by the Authenticity Committee to be allowed in Buhurt International events.\n● have a diameter:\n○ for Sword and Buckler (Duel): from 25 cm to 35 cm, ○ for Buhurt and Sword and Shield (Duel): from 25 cm to 70 cm,\n● be flat or have a concave curve,\n● have handles made of leather (see example in 6.2. Punch Shield).\n\nIt is not allowed to add a Shield boss (umbo) on a Round Shield unless documented by historical sources.",
