    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "9.2",
      "title": "Specific Requirements",
      "body": "Bucklers must:\n● conform to the General Requirements and either the Wooden Shield Requirements or the Metal Shield Requirements (see Sections 3, 4 and 5 above),\n● be made of wood or metal,\n● have a Shield boss (umbo):\n○ Shield boss must be made of metal.\n○ Shield boss can be riveted or forged.\n● have a diameter:\n○ for Buhurt: from 20 cm to 40 cm, ○ for Duels: from 20 cm to 35 cm,\n● be flat or curved depending on historical sources.\n\nIf the Buckler is made of wood, the handle must be made of wood.\nIf the Buckler is made of metal, the handle must be made of metal.\nA strap can be added to secure the Buckler in punch position. This strap must be made of leather.",
      "page_from": 17,
      "page_to": 17,
