      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "10.1",
      "title": "Historical Sources and Datation",
      "body": "Leather straps were fastened with nails or rivets.\nThe following methods are Approved for 14th century, Transitional and 15th century armors:\n● nails,\n● rivets,\n● modern nuts and bolts.\nExamples:\n\nNails Rivet with metal plate Pictures from Black Dog Armoury ©",
      "page_from": 19,
