    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "10.2",
      "title": "Specific requirements",
      "body": "Nails and rivets can be left visible.\nModern nuts and bolts must be concealed by one of the following methods:\n● Covered by a piece of leather nailed to the Shield.\n● Painted in black or any other color to make it concealed.\n● Hexagonal unpainted bolts must be ground to a rounded shape, replicating a rivet aesthetic.\nBolts must not protrude from the nuts.",
