      "number": "11",
      "title": "Changelog",
      "body": "Below, we will keep track of all the changes made over the lifetime of this document. This way, all our members can see how the documents are changing over time.\n\nApril - 2026 (V. 26.4) Add:\n- 3. General Requirements: “For the Marshals’ safety, it is prohibited to decorate Shields and Bucklers with black and yellow combinations, which include stripes, chevrons and other marshals symbols.”\n\nFebruary - 2026 (V. 26.2) Change:\n- 8.2 “Specific Requirements” of Round Shields: Maximum diameter changed from 35 to 70 cm for Sword and Shield (Duel).\n\nJanuary - 2026 (V. 26.1) Formatting redone for consistency and readability. Except points listed below, no content changes.\nAdd:\n- “1. Implementation” (and subsequent modification of all Title numbers in the document) Clarification:\n- Split of “1. Definition and general requirements” in “2. Definition” and “3. General Requirements”.\n- From 1.1. to “4. Wooden Shields requirements” and 1.2. to “5. Metal Shields Requirements”.\n- This doesn’t have an impact on the content of the rules.\nAdd: “1. Implementation” (and subsequent modification of all Title numbers in the document)\n- Modification of diameters for Round shields and Bucklers depending on the type of fight.\n\nMarch-2025 (V2025.02)\n- clarification : 6.2\n- format: Grammar and Formatting\n\nDecember-2024: -Add Document has been created",
